{"games":[{"id":120431902078318,"name":"Build & Survive","desc":"","path":"/game/120431902078318-build-survive","slug":"120431902078318-build-survive","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/38747691a60463032bc38929d7de3f1a1bc858753613c5cc321f805808d46abd.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-71e3da3661fd561558f7c298def2de13/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":0,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-09-14T04:10:12.244Z","creator":{"name":"Roblox","type":"User"},"script":{"count":8,"freeCount":8,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":100635310803794,"name":"Brainrot Nights - Five Nights at Brainrot Pizzeria","desc":"Welcome to your new night shift at the Brainrot Pizzeria, where chaos, memes, and questionable cuisine come together for a truly unforgettable experience! The main attraction is the bizarre cast of “Italian Brainrot” characters, they’re animatronic performers, designed to entertain guests with nonstop energy and absurd antics! Unfortunately, things tend to get strange after hours. Management decided it’s far cheaper to hire a night guard (that’s you) than to deal with whatever’s causing it.\n\nFrom your cramped security office, you’ll need to monitor the building using a network of cameras. But be careful—you only have a limited amount of power each night (thanks to recent budget cuts). Once it’s gone, so are your lights and doors… and your safety.\n\nIf something seems off—like a character not being where they should be—you’ll need to track them down on the cameras and defend yourself however you can.\n\nCan you survive a week of Brainrot Nights?","path":"/game/100635310803794-brainrot-nights","slug":"100635310803794-brainrot-nights","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/caa759ee1f2a2ae7c17548c6497090118d4b196584090da76901b6afd1a1a255.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-ac2d8875b625e449284ba1f09aa0efb1/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":7290,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-09-13T07:01:47.831Z",